    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi ghoadaw Sulemani ng'asheega huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gwaneekiit miyeeda Dawdi, goorgweaksa orjeedaanyi was Sulemani, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aniini nihidu miyeedeanyu. Asi milmiliida nea giimajeegi geaw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea giing'waanyi ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, nea giyaadi naweadingaaschi, nea giing'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi, nea ging'ulayi diigheanyeekaaschi atamanamughuush, ea deaweedajeagaaschi, ea ng'asheagaaschi rugu sing'oorsa jeeda deaweeda Musa, ak gimajeegiidi aba jeeda ng'asheega sean iisini aba heeda wassean iigali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gagasa gwasin NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheandaanyi ghayi rugu aba badaydeanyu, nea gwayi, ‘Inyas gaygooleeysiit diibigaagu naweadinga nyaawa, ak ghabeawa madeedeanyu nea doobiiweadi, aba gurooruunatka nyaawa sean, ea jeesinga nyaawa sean, manda siida jea ghoang'aamwaneey hoorgeeda Israeli.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama ng'ata ghoanali gidasimanean Yoabu was orjeeda Seruya, hinda fih iyeenya bea lugooda Israeli, Abneri was orjeeda Neri, ea Amasa was orjeeda Yeta, ghayi bwar nea ghawalda aba damanda hoyyoo was foojeanda ghayi weay aba jeeda ng'ucheeda, ak ghwayeasha foojeanda ghealooda manandeanyu; ea geeka mida geeshangeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi sinana weaghuumeeda, nea adiidu ginung' gawa uhuudaanyi bea ghearashka jeeda gheeda fuga miyeeda nea ghwaat hoyyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisisi ng'asheega doabiiw orjooga Barsilayi bea eemeeda Gileyadi, nung' gaba jeeda fuga agiisachi aba badayda measeadaang'u; aba doobiiwnata simanean damanda eamng'awi Absalomu was orjeeda geamadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gindeawi eara Shimeyi orjeeda Gera, bea dooshta Benjamini bea Bahurimu, mwaashtanaan mooshteayda haw damanda aabeawi Mahanaimu, nea gheata rarang'aana eeroonyeena aba Yordani, geayeaksi habeawooda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geayeeshi, ‘maydanuusnyi aba ng'uta.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adiidu gisiksi, aba gideaba guwoosi weaghoocheanda gaydaaha gichea simana niny, gajiina uhuudaanyi bea ghearashka ea foojeanda jeeda gheeda miyeeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghami Dawdi ak gawuurji gidaghayi meewiida ghweanigaaschi, ak geebung'sa jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eawoojiga ambali Dawdi fuga Israeli ghwanyiit gweanyeew haradam; goombaliischi gweanyeew ispwa aba Hermoni, ak gweanyeew diktam ea samwagu goombaliischi aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goopteadawa Sulemani hoorgeeda ghwaan, ak gamajeegiit sugoocheanduumeadaanyi muuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Adoniya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu Adoniyaheeda was orjeeda Hagiti heeda Batsheba was gheamata Sulemani. Hean gwayeesha gheamata, “Guwuni hoyyooohi?” Hean gwayeesha Adoniya, “Ea geayeadu hoyyoo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Geandeawi ng'asheanji jea darukuneey.” Ama ng'ata gwayeesha gheamata, “Heabi rukuni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Ginali gideaba sugoocheanduumeeda ghayi gaygabeahan, nea fuga sean bea Israeli gafurda gideaba gaydeambaliischi; ak ghamneawa ea niyam geaw ak ghoah dea orjeeda iya, niiw daanyi aba gideaba gwaleabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa geandeawi gilagi jea damusnyi; adiidu giheawi.” Hean gwayeesha gheamata, “Heapi rukuni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Geamuscheey, musa sugoocheanda was Sulemani, mayghaweadaneey gichea gagoonan Abishagi was huda eemeeda Shunami ghoah gatmoodeanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Batsheba, “Ghwadoabiiw; gaydeabalool aniini sugoocheanda aba gidimusi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Batsheba gawa heeda sugoocheanda was Sulemani, goobalool aba badayda Adoniya. Hean ghang'eat sugoocheanda gawa roonyeeda, ama ng'ata gwahiing'sa geaw; ak goopteada aba uhuuda hoorgeadaanyi, ak ghwanung' eeyeasa ghaamwat, hean goopteada ghaamwat aba meatkweadaanyi bea geatindaanyi bea dugwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha ghaamwat, “Geandeawi ng'asheanji mwanang' jea damusnyi, adiidu giheawi.” Ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda ghaamwat, “Rukuni gida igasayi; aba gideaba maydaheawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Nung' ghaghi orjeeda geamadu Abishagiheeda fuga Shunami ghoah gatmoadaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gobalool sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghaamwat, “Anda gigakiisi Adoniya Abishagiheeda was huda eemeeda Shunami gicha? Gakiisiina eara sugoocheanduumeeda; aba gideaba niny orjeeda haw gil bea iya, ak meatkweadaanyi gwanda Abiyatari was ashoohoocheanda ea Yoabu was orjeeda Seruya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweaksa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawooda sugoocheanda was Sulemani nea gwayi, “Sinnean ng'asheanji ea ghwanaawda iimaygahuteawi ng'asheanji eaweega Adoniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA, nigatgadaan, ea ghwayiinan uhuuda hoorgeeda Dawdi was ghweandeanyu, ak nea hean gwanyaknean gheeda, aba gidaghayi heeleesiinda, Adoniya gajeenuus askweari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta sugoocheanda was Sulemani Benaya was orjeeda Yehoyada; hean ghwalas, ak goobissa miyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hoonda Abiyatari ea miyeeda Yoabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda ashoohoocheanda siguura Abiyatari, nea gwayeesha, “Una ng'eanyiida Anatoti, jeeda madamnyeandaang'u aba gideaba ang'iing'i gihaguuw miyeeda. Nea ea maydaahaaknyi miyeeda aba ghamneawa. Aba gideaba ang'iing'i ghayi gisareani sandakwajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, nea giideayeewi Dawdeeda was bwaabwa, nea eara aba gideaba giiguuyeewi sawanaduutka sea bwaabwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sugoocheanda was Sulemani gageandeawa Abiyatari gadiyeeda Ashoohoocheanduumeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ghoah ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi rugu aba badayda gheeh Eli aba Shilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata gwahissa heeda Yoabu ng'asheesu, aba gideaba Yoabu ghwaat geeshta Adoniya nea ea mwaada geeshta Absalomu Yoabu gafachsa jeeda maheemajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghoang'waayi gujaka heeda wagiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean iinea geerukusa sugoocheanda was Sulemani, “Yoabu nifachsa jeeda maheemajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ging'ulayi, gwanda murdeeda heeda wagiida,” Goojeakta Sulemani orjeeda Yehoyada siguura Benaya, nea gwayeesha, “Una bwara ghami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu Benaya jeeda maheemajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi sugoocheanda, ‘Beeni jarooda.’” Hean gwayeesha niny, “Manda gaydameewsa hiji.” Ng'ata goodeelsa Benaya ng'asheanji sugoocheanda gicha, ak gwayeesha, “Nih ginyaashta Yoabu gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Hinda gida nyaashta niny, bwara ghami ak gibunyi; geandeawana ea ghaheanya foojeanda ahiida Yoabu mwadaagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygoodeelsa NG'UTAMIIDA foojeandaanyi uhuudaanyi, aba gideaba damanda mandeawana iita Dawdi was bwaabwa, gwanuus aba ng'uta fih iyeenya doobiiweadi ea ghang'al niny, Abneri was orjeeda Neri, shirikarajeanda haw bea lugooda Israeli, ea Amasa, orjeeda Yeta, was shirikarajeanda haw bea lugooda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean foojeanyeeka nyaawa gaygabiiksa uhuuda Yoabu ea iheenga jeacheangaaschi gida manda muudeanooda; ak aba Dawdi, ea gheanyi, ea hoorgeadaanyi, gaygaba hoyyooyda jea gwaleabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA gida manda muudeanooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat Benayeeda was orjeeda Yehoyada, ak ghabwar ea ghami; aba ng'ata geebung'sa jeedeaba gheanyi mida dareapcheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiin sugoocheanda hoorgeeda Yoabu Benayeeda was orjeeda Yehoyada, gamineadaysa lugooda, ak ghwayiin sugoocheanda Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda hoorgeeda Abiyatari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
