        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Shimeyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeaksa sugoocheanda eeguursa Shimeyi, ak gwayeesha, “Deeksiina geaw gheeda aba Yerusalemu ak giibiidi jeeda, nea adiidu ging'ami jeeda ak guwi hich nuut eara gawuurjiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba eaweeda ing'ami jeeda ak guwi ea aghaawana ghealooda siguura Gidroni, asi nala gideaba gaymeawa; nea foojeandaang'u gaygwanda uhuudaang'u ang'iing'i.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Shimeyi sugoocheanda, “Ng'asheanda irugu ghwadoabiiw; gawuurji gidarukuteayda Ng'utamiideanyu sugoocheanda, gayghoah gichea gwasinda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda.” Hean goobiida Shimeyi Yerusalemu eawoojiga saang'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu muudeanooda gweaydeaba samwagu gwasalda fih iyeenya bea gadiyeeda bea Shimeyi ak gaweay heeda Akishi, was orjeeda Maaka, was sugoocheanda Gati. Ak hean iinea geerukusa Shimeyi, “Ng'ula, fugaagu bea gadiyeeda gwanda Gati,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Shimeyi ak ghaghu digeeda, ak gawa Gati heeda Akishi, gagasa fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda. Gawa Shimei ak goodeelna fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ng'eanyiida Gati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea geerukusa Sulemani gideaba Shimeyi niweewa Yerusalemu ak gawa Gati ea gabiigu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean goojeakta sugoocheanda buuneeda gaguursa Shimeyi, ak gwayeesha, “Heapi meanung' aksiina habeawooda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea geerukuneey gideaba, ‘Nala gideaba eaweeda ing'ameewi hiji ak guwi hich nuut gaymeawa’? Ak giyeeshiinean, ‘Gidirgu ghoadoabiiw; ak hean ghaamwaschi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anda mii ang'waanya habeawooda NG'UTAMIIDA ea diigheanda eagoonyeeyi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha sugoocheanda Shimeyi, “Ang'iing'i ginali aba gurooroadaang'u gida muy isimi Dawdi was bwaabwa; ak ghamneawa gaygoodeelseey NG'UTAMIIDA munyindaang'u uhuudaang'u ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sugoocheanda was Sulemani gajeataw ghawooda, nea hoorgeeda Dawdi gajeemajeek aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA damanda manda muudeanooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta sugoocheanda Benayeeda was orjeeda Yehoyada; hean gawa ak ghabwar ea gwanuus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
